/Title (The curve shows a large benefit from low-code for simple needs. As complexity, transaction volume and integration demands increase, that benefit falls, while custom code stays fairly steady. The shaded hybrid zone marks where using both together is usually best. The chart is a conceptual illustration, not measured data.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 401 0 R
/Next 554 0 R
>>
