475 0 obj
<<
/Title (The case study found that low-code is very effective for the routine parts of an enterprise lending system: loan application forms, approvals, notifications and ecosystem integrations. It delivers quickly with little code, whichever platform is chosen.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 403 0 R
/Next 558 0 R
>>
endobj
476 0 obj
<<
/Title (The recommended solution is a hybrid approach: keep low-code for forms, workflows and screens, and add an API or middleware layer with custom services for heavy logic, core banking integration and analytics, under clear governance. No live testing or benchmark was carried out; the conclusions come from analysis of the case.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 403 0 R
/Prev 558 0 R
>>
