/Title (The case study asks three things: where low-code clearly helps, where it begins to struggle as scale and complexity increase, and how a hybrid design can keep the speed of low-code while covering its weak points.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 467 0 R
/Prev 545 0 R
>>
endobj
547 0 obj
<<
/Title (Derive the requirements. The scenario was split into six requirement areas: scale, business rules, integration, security and compliance, tailored screens, and long-term upkeep \(Section 3.2\).)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 400 0 R
/Prev 468 0 R
/Next 599 0 R
>>
