550 0 obj
<<
/Title (The map places a generic low-code platform at the centre of the bank. Built-in platform services and ready-made connectors are well supported \(green\). Credit bureau, KYC and payment gateway APIs, and the country-by-country lending, privacy and audit rules, are possible with effort \(amber\). The legacy core banking system or mainframe, and credit scoring or risk analytics, are strained and usually need custom code \(red\).)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 470 0 R
/Next 602 0 R
>>
endobj
