557 0 obj
<<
/Title (The low-code platform keeps the forms, approvals and screens, and relies on built-in services for sign-in and messages. An API gateway or middleware layer links it to custom services for credit scoring and fraud checks, to the core banking and payment systems, and to a data warehouse and audit store. Monitoring, role-based access and governance cover every layer.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 474 0 R
/Prev 556 0 R
/First 614 0 R
/Last 614 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
558 0 obj
<<
/Title (For a complex, global use case, the main limitations were performance at scale, complex logic, legacy and industry integration, restricted customisation, compliance and data-residency control, weak testing and change control, app sprawl and vendor lock-in. These were examined in the limitation table, the conceptual chart and the suitability chart.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 403 0 R
/Prev 475 0 R
/Next 476 0 R
>>
endobj
